So to sum everything up, I've called this meeting so we can decide the best way to provide aid to the Heart Kingdom.

290
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:14,920
Queen Laura Petchka plans to invade the Spade Kingdom in six months' time, before she becomes too weak.

291
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:18,920
We're considering deploying our own forces to fight alongside them.

292
00:14:18,920 --> 00:14:23,920
I'm asking each one of you to make sure your squads are as strong as you can.

293
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:29,920
We only have six months, but please do everything possible to raise their stages to one.

294
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:35,920
We must defeat Spade to protect the residents of Heart, as well as our own land.

295
00:14:35,920 --> 00:14:41,920
I've been informed by Queen Laura Petchka that the Spirit Guardians are also going to contribute.

296
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:43,920
Can I count on you?

297
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:44,920
