301
00:14:55,920 --> 00:14:57,920
Yes, William?

302
00:14:57,920 --> 00:15:03,920
I'll participate in the battle. However, as you all know, the things I did in the past were unforgivable,

303
00:15:03,920 --> 00:15:07,920
and I believe I am no longer worthy of facing my squad as captain.

304
00:15:07,920 --> 00:15:11,920
And so, with a heavy heart, I request that you relieve me of my position.

305
00:15:11,920 --> 00:15:12,920
Huh?

306
00:15:12,920 --> 00:15:13,920
Wait!

307
00:15:13,920 --> 00:15:17,920
If you would, sir, I'd like you to assign me a new mission.

308
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:21,920
It would be an honor to put my life on the line to help overthrow this devil.

309
00:15:21,920 --> 00:15:23,920
Captain Fongens...

310
00:15:23,920 --> 00:15:26,920
If he's to blame in this, then so am I.

311
00:15:26,920 --> 00:15:31,920
Although my body was possessed by an elf at the time, I have committed unspeakable crimes.

312
00:15:31,920 --> 00:15:33,920
I should be put to death.

313
00:15:33,920 --> 00:15:38,920
I failed as well. It isn't right to call myself a captain.

314
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:42,920
Eh, I don't feel all that bad about it, actually.

315
00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:44,920
Oh, really? Cause you should.

316
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:46,920
Alright, I've heard enough.

317
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:50,920
I understand why some of you may be feeling ashamed of what happened.

318
00:15:50,920 --> 00:15:54,920
That being said, I cannot and will not take away your responsibilities as captains.

319
00:15:54,920 --> 00:16:00,920
If I did, I'd have to extend the same treatment to the other magic knights who fell under control of the elves,

320
00:16:00,920 --> 00:16:02,920
