334
00:16:41,920 --> 00:16:45,920
But surely you can table that decision until after this is dealt with, yes?

335
00:16:48,920 --> 00:16:50,920
I suppose I don't object.

336
00:16:51,920 --> 00:16:53,920
But let me be quite clear.

337
00:16:53,920 --> 00:16:57,920
I've chosen to cooperate only because I believe this is the most beneficial strategy

338
00:16:57,920 --> 00:16:59,920
for the Clover Kingdom at large.

339
00:17:00,920 --> 00:17:02,920
Now, please excuse me.

340
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:08,920
I know where he can shove those damn scales.

341
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:11,920
Wow, you really got me off the hook, Wizard King. Thank you so much.

342
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:13,920
There's no need to thank me.

343
00:17:14,920 --> 00:17:16,920
Okay, but I'm super grateful.

344
00:17:18,920 --> 00:17:20,920
Anyway, I'm expecting great things from you.

345
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:21,920
Keke!

346
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:22,920
You can depend on me!

347
00:17:23,920 --> 00:17:25,920
I can't wait to slice up my subordinates!

348
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:27,920
That's one way to trim the fat!

349
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:29,920
Not the point.

350
00:17:30,920 --> 00:17:31,920
This'll be fun!

351
00:17:32,920 --> 00:17:33,920
I'll start creating our training regimen immediately.

352
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:36,920
Actually, it might be best if all the squads do this together.

353
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:39,920
That's a good idea. We could hold mock battles.

354
00:17:40,920 --> 00:17:41,920
Keke! I'm not holding back!

355
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:43,920
That's my line, freak!

356
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:45,920
Perhaps we should go ahead and enlist a few healing mages.

357
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:47,920
I'm sure we're going to need them.

358
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:49,920
Don't get too carried away.

359
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:53,920
