362
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:03,920
Hey, it's the Hamhawk again.

363
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:06,920
Obviously all of you are familiar with Gelder Poizat,

364
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:09,920
