365
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:12,920
He was recently caught in a crime, robbing the Shadow Palace.

366
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:17,920
He and Revchi, the disgraced former magic knight who was once his superior,

367
00:18:18,920 --> 00:18:22,920
