380
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:57,920
I'd like him to use that extra money for the benefit of the Clover Kingdom.

381
00:18:58,920 --> 00:19:00,920
The repairs we've been doing are far from cheap after all,

382
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:04,920
