392
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:31,920
You better make sure you fetch us a good price at the market, little piggy.

393
00:19:31,920 --> 00:19:34,920
That's right! Because if you screw this up, you're going straight to the chopping block!

394
00:19:35,920 --> 00:19:36,920
There's just one more thing.

395
00:19:37,920 --> 00:19:38,920
As I explained to you all a few moments ago,

396
00:19:39,920 --> 00:19:41,920
