429
00:21:02,920 --> 00:21:03,920
I'll throw up!

430
00:21:05,920 --> 00:21:07,920
I bet your old golden guts can stick around!

431
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:09,920
Yeah, you got time!

432
00:21:10,920 --> 00:21:11,920
Come on, heroes! Save the kingdom!

433
00:21:12,920 --> 00:21:14,920
Do us a favor and join us for a quick game!

434
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:16,920
Game?

435
00:21:16,920 --> 00:21:19,920
We'll get our salary back by making you gamblers away!

436
00:21:20,920 --> 00:21:21,920
Fine, I'll play.

437
00:21:22,920 --> 00:21:24,920
We're about to clean you out!

438
00:21:29,920 --> 00:21:30,920
Typical.

439
00:21:31,920 --> 00:21:32,920
I won again.

440
00:21:33,920 --> 00:21:35,920
I got three times my page.

441
00:21:37,920 --> 00:21:39,920
I'm truly grateful to both of you.

442
00:21:40,920 --> 00:21:43,920
Despite what happened, you haven't treated me the least bit differently.

443
00:21:44,920 --> 00:21:49,920
You have my word. I'm going to do everything in my power to defeat that devil.

444
00:21:52,920 --> 00:21:53,920
Good night then.

445
00:21:54,920 --> 00:21:57,920
Here you are, sir. I'm sorry my friends made such a racket.

446
00:21:59,920 --> 00:22:00,920
Thank you very much.

447
00:22:00,920 --> 00:22:01,920
Thank you.

448
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:31,920
Thank you.

449
